1. Count weekdays (excluding weekends) from Saturday, October 21 to Sunday, December 31, 1995 (including both start and end). So we need number of Mon-Fri days inclusive. Range: Oct 21 to Dec 31, 1995. Start: Oct 21, end: Dec 31. We'll compute total days inclusive, then subtract weekends.

