So Q1: 50.

2. Between Thursday, January 26, 1995 and Saturday, February 11, 1995 (both dates inclusive), count of business days (Mon-Fri). Range: Jan 26 to Feb 11. Need to compute day-of-week for these. Jan 26: Jan 1 is day1, Jan 26 = 26. Day_of_year = 26. (26-1)=25 mod7=4? 25/7=3*7=21, remainder4, so Thursday (since Sunday=0, Mon=1, Tue=2, Wed=3, Thu=4, Fri=5, Sat=6). So Jan 26 is Thursday. Feb 11: Feb 1 = 32, Feb 11 = 32+10=42? Actually Feb 11 = Feb1 +10 = 32+10=42. Day_of_year=42. (42-1)=41 mod7=41-35=6, so Saturday. So start Thu, end Sat. Need total days inclusive: From Jan 26 to Feb 11. Jan has 31 days, so Jan 26 to Jan 31 inclusive = 6 days (26,27,28,29,30,31). Then Feb 1-11 = 11 days. Total = 6+11 = 17 days. Check: Jan 26 to Feb 11 inclusive is 17 days. Or compute day numbers: Jan 26 day=26, Feb 11 day=42, inclusive = 42-26+1=17. OK.

